  "responsibility_boundary": "Wave 8 separates Agent run orchestration from the reusable runtime execution owner while retaining the earlier Agent CLI, Work Lab, and Skill command owners behind stable facades.",
  "cohesion_rationale": "The run runtime owner is the minimum cohesive extraction that reduces run_agent.py below 1000 lines without splitting orchestration policy into arbitrary buckets; the exact scope renews the complete owner-wide issue root.",
