    "Keeping runtime execution inside run_agent.py would retain mixed orchestration and execution responsibilities.",
    "Splitting runtime behavior into arbitrary line-sized helpers would scatter lifecycle invariants and failure handling.",
    "Relabeling handwritten files or changing stable facades would hide responsibility or break supported imports instead of reducing complexity."
